  "html": "<div id=\"step-q135466\" class=\"step questionWidget\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 17</div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\"><p>A certain cinema sells three types of popcorn: traditional, butter, and caramelized. The following table describes how the number of customers changes between the three types of popcorn each month:</p>\n<table rules=\"all\" cellpadding=\"10\" align=\"center\" style=\"border:1px solid black; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 4mm; margin-top: 4mm\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"border:hidden\"></td>\n<td style=\"border:hidden\"></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center; border-top:hidden; border-right:hidden\">From:</td> \n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:hidden\"></td>\n<td></td>\n<td width=\"60\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b>Traditional</b></td>\n<td width=\"60\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b>Butter</b></td> \n<td width=\"60\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b>Caramelized</b></td> \n</tr>\n<tr> \n<td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center; border-left:hidden; border-bottom:hidden\">To:</td>\n<td width=\"60\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b>Traditional</b></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"405\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0.4</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtm